  "steps": [
    "Roast the almonds, flax seeds and pumpkin seeds until they turn lightly golden.",
    "Add the roasted nuts and seeds to a blender along with the salt and cinnamon. Blend until the mixture reaches a thick, buttery consistency.",
    "Add the dates and cocoa powder, then blend again until a sticky dough forms.",
    "Roll the mixture into 22 equal-sized fudge balls.",
    "Coat each ball in the roasted sesame seeds, roasted desiccated coconut, or a mix of both.",
    "Refrigerate for 20–30 minutes and enjoy your healthy chocolate fudge balls!"
